witter.com/cipherworks</a> 》<br />\n<br />\n☆制作・監修/◆Black　Ocean◆<br />\n《 <a href=\"http://saifa.blog38.fc2.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://saifa.blog38.fc2.com/</a> 》"}]}],"description":"2人の○●っ娘とエレベーターに閉じ込められた話。","short_introduction":"2人の○●っ娘とエレベーターに閉じ込められた話。","options":["SND","REV","DLP","ORW","RegionHiddenFilter"],"url":"https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ219371.html","site_id":"maniax","fetched_at":1795540061}